    "note": "The pinned command is arm A; arms B and C use the same command with --arm B or C and their own --out file, and the 2020 to 2024 proof file comes from --window holdout --arm A. Each arm writes a run-once claim file in the git-ignored study folder and the early-window driver refuses to run while a claim exists, so a replay needs the owner to clear the claims or a scratch clone without them. The window is used, so a replay is a reproduction check, not a new test. Each arm takes 7 to 13 minutes. The provenance blocks in the result files were added after the runs from fields already in them."
